    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This brave Convict Soldier was dispatched by Einhasad to help her daughter, Anakim, after watching her struggle at the battle with Lilim. He was given powerful golden armor and may be the ancestor of today's Platinum Tribe. He valiantly protected Anakim during many battles before finally being slain in the Catacomb of the Apostate. When the Seal of the Seven Signs was broken, he was resurrected thanks to the power of Einhasad released in the Seal Stone. Angels Lv. 8 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Angels. M. Def. +5% Accuracy +10 Resistance to Holy +10% Atk. Spd. -5% Resistance to Dark -10% Resistance to debuffs +15% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
